id: pm-vcs-renewal-heap-26
title: Investigate Node 26 heap exhaustion in the renewal closure coverage test
description: "The Node 26 coverage shard for PR #205 at 7dd2d671155e253c5aa3612f7f59b0379f77ce06 failed in the renewal closure discards leaf bytes test. The 32 MiB child process hit its JavaScript heap limit on Node 26.13.1. The PR diff consists of tracker records, changelog and the generated self-host bundle. An isolated instrumented run on main 84b97b6 with Node 26.13.0 passed 1/1. Compare the exact coverage shard and runtime with instrumented and uninstrumented controls before changing the fixture or its memory contract. Evidence: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-vcs/actions/runs/45152947426/job/137618937076."
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 2
tags[3]: ci,coverage,memory
created_at: "2026-11-23T10:24:00.970Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-23T10:25:26.383Z"
author: codex-agent
comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-23T10:25:24.129Z",codex-agent,The linked focused check also passed on the local Node 26.13.0 instrumented run. The CI 26.13.1 shard failure remains unresolved.
